  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 3202.03 Authorized or Approved Carriers. Financial institutions shall offer only insurance products of insurance companies licensed and authorized or approved to do business in New Hampshire.\n\nSource. #7064, eff 7-24-99",
